# Runtime audit JSONL — written by the runner on every run (smoke or real).
# During smoke / dev these are throwaway. The real-run JSONL that
# substantiates the writeup is added explicitly via `git add -f` as part
# of the corpus publication commit.
procurement-decisions/results/audit/*.jsonl
